blocks.en:
For window advancement, both roles reindex temporal RoPE to local positions
and transform cached keys without another model evaluation. Training and inference share this rule;
Appendix A.3 details RoPE and retained anchors.

blocks.zh:
为推进窗口,两个角色将时间ROPE重新编入当地职位
并转换缓存密钥,而不另作模型评价。 培训和推论赞同这一规则;
附录A.3详细介绍了ROPE和保留锚.

blocks.en:
WM training uses camera-annotated navigation video;
refinement additionally uses natural HR video with synthetic spatial
degradation.

blocks.zh:
WM培训使用照相机附加说明的导航录像;
进一步使用带有合成空间的自然HR视频
退化。

